{"title":"2013 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rewrite the equation of the line from part (a) in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/6/c46b3af3d4e2f7eebdb4de85d4f288dc86d235db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{c} + \\frac{y}{d} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"85\" height=\"34\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are integers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2013 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1a\">part a</a>, the line is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fc9c81292932c0fe9ca03bc68a82e97d967d68c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -2x + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"17\" />. From this, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/9005351ccdea4eee93bf06b4a00bf8c6d5d238dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + y = 2x - 2x + 4 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"203\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>We notice that our desired equation has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> on the left side. To get this, we can divide both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d13f4a1700755ddba70461132e810536f6148d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{4} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/2/b320f774d5cd2172b25a874f5697e7d44adf49df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2x + y}{4} = \\frac{4}{4} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"128\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Splitting the fraction on the left into two different fractions, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/6/3a6dab7b9652b2c20785f71d62d6162996ff7233.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2x}{4} + \\frac{y}{4} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/8/1e8ddfccb00d11de7672b93ec825d499ae4639f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\frac{x}{2} + \\frac{y}{4} = 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"97\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232515\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2063/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.768      1 2013_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.768      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35635:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232515 and revision id 278084. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}